    },
    {
        "text": "mudaf ilayhi. Fine.",
        "start": 934.72,
        "end": 937.76
    },
    {
        "text": "The rest of the things you will read",
        "start": 939.0,
        "end": 943.32
    },
    {
        "text": "yourself and do it. These three things",
        "start": 940.6,
        "end": 946.24
    },
    {
        "text": "will answer. Okay? We will answer these",
        "start": 943.32,
        "end": 949.0400000000001
    },
    {
        "text": "three things, brothers, sisters.",
        "start": 946.24,
        "end": 952.32
    },
    {
        "text": "Ayna kitabun Muhammadin? The answer has",
        "start": 949.04,
        "end": 955.28
    },
    {
        "text": "to be from the main text. Ayna kitabun",
        "start": 952.32,
        "end": 957.0400000000001
    },
    {
        "text": "Muhammadin?",
        "start": 955.28,
        "end": 958.8
    },
    {
        "text": "What will the answer?",
        "start": 957.04,
        "end": 960.0799999999999
    },
    {
        "text": "Huwa",
        "start": 958.8,
        "end": 964.4399999999999
    },
    {
        "text": "alal maktabi hunaka. Are you with me?",
        "start": 960.08,
        "end": 968.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Huwa alal maktabi hunaka. Ayna kitabun",
        "start": 964.44,
        "end": 970.8000000000001
    },
    {
        "text": "Ammarin?",
        "start": 968.6,
        "end": 971.84
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhm?",
        "start": 970.8,
        "end": 974.4399999999999
    },
    {
        "text": "Huwa alal maktabil mudarrisi.",
        "start": 971.84,
        "end": 977.2
    },
    {
        "text": "There it says uh daftar,",
        "start": 974.44,
        "end": 980.0400000000001
    },
    {
        "text": "but you can say huwa alal maktabil",
        "start": 977.2,
        "end": 983.0400000000001
    },
    {
        "text": "mudarrisi. Fine, brother.",
        "start": 980.04,
        "end": 986.4399999999999
    },
    {
        "text": "Ayna haqibatul mudarrisi?",
        "start": 983.04,
        "end": 988.16
    },
    {
        "text": "Hiya",
        "start": 986.44,
        "end": 991.6400000000001
    },
    {
        "text": "tahtal maktabi. It is under the",
        "start": 988.16,
        "end": 993.16
    },
    {
        "text": "table. Got the idea, brothers and",
        "start": 991.64,
        "end": 995.96
    },
    {
        "text": "sisters? Inshallah, we end here. Please",
        "start": 993.16,
        "end": 999.0799999999999
    },
    {
        "text": "try to do as much as you can at home.",
        "start": 995.96,
        "end": 1002.0400000000001
    },
    {
        "text": "Specially the next few pages of the",
        "start": 999.08,
        "end": 1003.5200000000001
    },
    {
        "text": "lesson.",
        "start": 1002.04,
        "end": 1004.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "start": 1003.52,
        "end": 1007.8
    },
    {
        "text": "And then we we will move forward. I hope",
        "start": 1004.4,
        "end": 1010.8
    },
    {
        "text": "you have come with lots of sacrifices",
        "start": 1007.8,
        "end": 1012.4799999999999
    },
    {
        "text": "for 4 days.",
        "start": 1010.8,
        "end": 1015.4
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope you enjoyed the lessons, and I",
        "start": 1012.48,
        "end": 1019.32
    },
    {
        "text": "hope you find that it is definitely",
        "start": 1015.4,
        "end": 1021.4399999999999
    },
    {
        "text": "helping you to understand",
        "start": 1019.32,
        "end": 1023.5200000000001
    },
    {
        "text": "many things now that you did not know",
        "start": 1021.44,
        "end": 1026.0
    },
    {
        "text": "before. And I hope",
        "start": 1023.52,
        "end": 1028.76
    },
    {
        "text": "you find it interesting. Inshallah.",
        "start": 1026.0,
        "end": 1032.12
    },
    {
        "text": "You find that learning Arabic is a joy.",
        "start": 1028.76,
        "end": 1035.64
    },
    {
        "text": "Learning Learning Arabic is fun.",
        "start": 1032.12,
        "end": 1038.9589999999998
    },
    {
        "text": "Learning Arabic is enjoyable. Learning",
        "start": 1035.64,
        "end": 1041.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Arabic is fascinating.",
        "start": 1038.959,
        "end": 1043.52
    },
    {
        "text": "Inshallah, Allah will make it easy for",
        "start": 1041.4,
        "end": 1045.0
    },
    {
        "text": "us soon, so",
        "start": 1043.52,
        "end": 1047.839
    },
    {
        "text": "Rabbana",
        "start": 1045.0,
        "end": 1047.839
    },
    {
        "text": "Rabbana",
        "start": 1051.84,
        "end": 1054.8
    },
    {
        "text": "Rabbana",
        "start": 1058.12,
        "end": 1061.08
    },
    {
        "text": "Rabbana",
        "start": 1066.08,
        "end": 1069.04
    },
    {
        "text": "Rabbana",
        "start": 1081.48,
        "end": 1084.48
    },
    {
        "text": "Subhana",
        "start": 1091.72,
        "end": 1094.08
    },
    {
        "text": "Alhamdulillah Rabbil Alameen.",
        "start": 1097.76,
        "end": 1102.12
    }
]